{"_meta":{"fastmcp":{"tags":["Reports","jobmojito","jobmojito-api"]},"jobmojito":{"category":"Reports","http_method":"POST"}},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":true,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Save a custom report"},"description":"[Reports] Without report_id: save a new custom report from a definition (schema jobmojito.report/v1); it is created as Only me and is shared from the returned admin_url. With report_id and the version from get_report: replace that report's whole definition; on a report shared with other people the change is saved as a draft that the owner publishes in the admin, a private report updates at once, whatever `target` says. run_report with a `definition` and no report_id validates one without saving it.\n\nEvery argument in full, with examples: get_tool_reference.","inputSchema":{"properties":{"conversation_id":{"description":"The conversation_id this server returned earlier in this conversation, unchanged, including after later user messages. Omit it if you have none. Recorded for the server developer's analytics.","type":"string"},"definition":{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"A custom report: report-wide filters and up to 12 blocks.","properties":{"blocks":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"compare":{"enum":["previous_period"],"type":"string"},"dataset":{"type":"string"},"dimensions":{"items":{"anyOf":[{"pattern":"^[a-z][a-z0-9_]{0,40}$","type":"string"},{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"field":{"pattern":"^[a-z][a-z0-9_]{0,40}$","type":"string"},"grain":{"enum":["day","week","month","quarter","year"],"type":"string"}},"required":["field"],"type":"object"}]},"maxItems":2,"type":"array"},"id":{"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{1,40}$","type":"string"},"limit":{"maximum":500.0,"minimum":1.0,"type":"integer"},"measures":{"items":{"pattern":"^[a-z][a-z0-9_]{0,40}$","type":"string"},"maxItems":6,"minItems":1,"type":"array"},"sort":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,